sequenceDiagram
    %% OVIC EON — Model Inference Execution Flow
    %% Document ID: EON-ARCH-DIAG-MOD-FLOW-001

    autonumber
    participant Engine as L4 Engine (e.g. ERG)
    participant Reg as L7 Model Adapter Registry
    participant Adapter as L7 Inference Adapter (e.g. LlamaCpp)
    participant HW as Hardware Backend (CPU SIMD)
    participant Rule as Deterministic Rule Fallback

    Engine->>Reg: predict(model_id, input_tensors, timeout=350ms)
    Reg->>Adapter: Route to active execution session
    alt Model Healthy & Within Budget
        Adapter->>HW: Execute tensor forward pass (Worker Thread)
        HW-->>Adapter: Return logits / tokens
        Adapter-->>Reg: Format output into typed contract
        Reg-->>Engine: Return PredictionResult
    else Model Crash / OOM / Timeout
        Adapter-->>Reg: Raise ModelInferenceError
        Note over Reg: INITIATE DETERMINISTIC FALLBACK
        Reg->>Rule: Select approved safety template
        Rule-->>Reg: Return deterministic fallback response (<5ms)
        Reg-->>Engine: Return FallbackResult (Flagged: degraded=True)
    end
